Peter 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>as long. 14; 2Co 5:1-4,8; Heb 13:3 to stir. 3:1; Hag 1:14; 2Ti 1:6 by. 12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-14","title":"2 Peter 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>shortly. De 4:21,22; 31:14; Jos 23:14; 1Ki 2:2,3; Ac 20:25; 2Ti 4:6 even. Joh 21:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-15","title":"2 Peter 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will. De 31:19-29; Jos 24:24-29; 1Ch 29:1-20; Ps 71:18; 2Ti 2:2; Heb 11:4 these. 4-7,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-16","title":"2 Peter 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>we have. 3:3,4; 1Co 1:17,23; 2:1,4; 2Co 2:17; 4:2; 12:16,17; Eph 4:14; 2Th 2:9 1Ti 1:4; 4:7; Tit 1:14 the power. Mt 28:18; Mr 9:1; Joh 17:2; Ro 1:4; 1Co 5:4; Php 3:21 coming. Mal 3:2; 4:5; Mt 16:28; 24:3,27; 1Co 1:7; Jude 1:14; Re 1:7 were. Mt 17:1-5; Mr 9:2; Lu 9:28-32; Joh 1:14; 1Jo 1:1-3; 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-17","title":"2 Peter 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>God. Mt 11:25-27; 28:19; Lu 10:22; Joh 3:35; 5:21-23,26,36,37 Joh 6:27,37,39; 10:15,36; 13:1-3; 14:6,8,9,11; 17:21; 20:17; Ro 15:6 2Co 1:3; 11:31; 2Jo 1:3; Jude 1:1 there came. Mt 17:3; Mr 9:7; Lu 9:34,35; Joh 12:28,29 This. Mt 3:17; 17:5; Mr 1:11; 9:7; Lu 3:22; 9:35 in whom. Isa 42:1; 53:10; Mt 12:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-18","title":"2 Peter 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>this. Mt 17:6 the holy. Ge 28:16,17; Ex 3:1,5; Jos 5:15; Isa 11:9; 56:7; Zec 8:3; Mt 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-19","title":"2 Peter 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>a more. Ps 19:7-9; Isa 8:20; 41:21-23,26; Lu 16:29-31; Joh 5:39; Ac 17:11 ye do. Ac 15:29; Jas 2:8; 3Jo 1:6 a light. Ps 119:105; Pr 6:23; Isa 9:2; 60:1,2; Mt 4:16; Lu 1:78,79 Joh 1:7-9; 5:35; 8:12; Eph 5:7,8 the day. 2Co 4:4-6; 1Jo 5:10; Re 2:28; 22:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-20","title":"2 Peter 1:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Knowing. 3:3; Ro 6:6; 13:11; 1Ti 1:9; Jas 1:3 that. Ro 12:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-1-21","title":"2 Peter 1:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the prophecy. Lu 1:70; 2Ti 3:16; 1Pe 1:11 in old time. or, at any time holy. De 33:1; Jos 14:6; 1Ki 13:1; 17:18,24; 2Ki 4:7,9,22; 6:10,15 1Ch 23:14; 2Ch 8:14 spake. Nu 16:28; 2Sa 23:2; Mic 3:7; Lu 1:70; 2Ti 3:15-17; 1Pe 1:11 Re 19:10 by the Holy. Mr 12:36; Ac 1:16; 3:18; 28:25; Heb 3:7; 9:8; 10:15</p>"}]}